      <string>Description</string>
      <string>3-bit unsigned to 4-bit two's complement negation: -X = ~X + 1.
先把 3 位零扩展到 4 位，按位取反，再用习题 1 的 4 位后继器加 1。</string>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <string>shapeType</string>
      <shapeType>CUSTOM</shapeType>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <string>Width</string>
      <int>5</int>
    </entry>
    <entry>
